```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner delete --help
Delete a quiescent Scherzo Cloud runner registration

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner delete [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name

Options:
      --yes                  Confirm permanent runner deletion
      --json                 Print the runner result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
